NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This licence covers only the code in this repository. The toolkit invokes
third-party programs that are NOT included here and are governed by their own
licences - notably rycolab and ryzen-smu-cli (both GPL-3.0), y-cruncher
(freeware, not open source) and HWiNFO64 (free for personal use).

If you redistribute a bundle that includes any of those programs, their terms
apply to that bundle. See docs/EXTERNAL_DEPENDENCIES.md.

This software performs hardware stress testing. It can push a CPU, memory and
cooling system to their limits. Nothing here protects against an unsafe
configuration; it makes the effects visible and recorded. Use it on hardware you
are willing to risk, and read AGENT.md before running anything unattended.
